  vignettes:
  - image: {fileID: -1751215814, guid: 9a58ea4a2fcecee4290b0f42dc7ed74e, type: 3}
    text: "You are about to enter a cave world, which represents your own consciousness\u2026"
  - image: {fileID: -1901202311, guid: 9a58ea4a2fcecee4290b0f42dc7ed74e, type: 3}
    text: "You will have to make your way with incredible ingenuity through the magic
      crystals and get to the mirror tests\u2026"
  - image: {fileID: -1473104871, guid: 9a58ea4a2fcecee4290b0f42dc7ed74e, type: 3}
    text: Then you will overcome the path through the cliffs and meet the demons...
      who may not look like what they are...
  - image: {fileID: 953630571, guid: 9a58ea4a2fcecee4290b0f42dc7ed74e, type: 3}
    text: "And so, you will arrive at the bonfire of confrontations, where you can
      make a big difference\u2026"
